### 環境變數設定（可切換 Local 或 K8s Ingress）
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 健康檢查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. 建立 Job（標準成功案例 - crawler）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system_id": "crawler",
  "task_id": "flow-run-test-001",
  "namespace": "ns-sep",
  "image": "python:3.11-alpine",
  "command": ["python", "-c", "print('Hello SEP (Serverless Execution Platform)!')"]
}

### 3. 建立 Job（無 command，使用 image 預設 CMD）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system_id": "reporting",
  "task_id": "flow-run-test-002",
  "namespace": "ns-sep",
  "image": "busybox:latest"
}

### 4. 異常測試：系統未註冊配額（預期報錯）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system_id": "not_exist_system",
  "task_id": "flow-run-test-err",
  "image": "python:3.11-alpine"
}

### 5. 異常測試：缺少必填欄位 task_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system_id": "crawler",
  "image": "python:3.11-alpine"
}
